    Show OK for http->https same-host redirects; fix py3.8
    
    Redirect to the same host/subdomain over https is a normal upgrade,
    not a suspicious redirect: report green OK instead of green REDIR in
    both TLS and HTTP probes. Replace str.removeprefix (py3.9+) with
    _strip_www helper - the win7 build targets Python 3.8.

